// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// Superboard Phase 2 — Supabase PostgreSQL Schema
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// Lean whiteboard SaaS: No Student, Homework, Scheduling,
// Invoice, or Recording models. Students are anonymous
// (ephemeral via Yjs awareness). Rooms auto-purge after 7 days.
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

datasource db {
  provider  = "postgresql"
  url       = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

// ── User (Tutor accounts only. Students have no DB model.) ──

model User {
  id                String    @id @default(uuid())
  email             String    @unique
  name              String?
  tier              String    @default("FREE") // FREE | PRO | AGENCY
  isAdmin           Boolean   @default(false)
  stripeCustomerId  String?   @unique
  fingerprintHash   String?
  // Agency fields
  parentAgencyId    String?
  brandingLogoUrl   String?
  brandingColor     String?
  agencyName        String?
  createdAt         DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt         DateTime  @updatedAt

  // Relations
  rooms        Room[]
  templates    Template[]
  usageLogs    UsageLog[]
  sentInvites  AgencyInvite[]
  agencyMembers AgencyMember[] @relation("AgencyOwner")
  agencyMemberships AgencyMember[] @relation("AgencyTutor")

  @@index([parentAgencyId])
}

// ── Agency Member (sub-tutor relationship) ──

model AgencyMember {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId    String   // User ID of the agency owner
  tutorId     String   // User ID of the invited tutor
  joinedAt    DateTime @default(now())

  agency User @relation("AgencyOwner", fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  tutor  User @relation("AgencyTutor", fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([agencyId, tutorId])
  @@index([tutorId])
}

// ── Agency Invite (invitation codes for agency tier) ──

model AgencyInvite {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId     String
  code         String   @unique
  invitedEmail String?
  recipientId  String?  @unique // set when accepted
  status       String   @default("PENDING") // PENDING | ACCEPTED | EXPIRED
  expiresAt    DateTime
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  agency User @relation(fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([status])
  @@index([code])
}

// ── Room (Session rooms — ephemeral, auto-purged after 7 days) ──

model Room {
  id              String    @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId         String
  subject         String    @default("GENERAL") // MATH | SCIENCE | LANGUAGE | GENERAL
  isActive        Boolean   @default(true)
  startedAt       DateTime?
  endedAt         DateTime?
  durationMinutes Int       @default(0)
  // Branding snapshot (frozen at room creation)
  brandingLogo    String?
  brandingColor   String?
  createdAt       DateTime  @default(now())

  // Relations
  tutor     User       @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  pages     BoardPage[]
  chatMessages ChatMessage[]

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([isActive])
}

// ── Board Page (SVG element snapshots per page) ──

model BoardPage {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  roomId    String
  pageIndex Int
  snapshot  Json     // Serialized SVG elements array
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @db.Timestamp(6)

  room Room @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([roomId, pageIndex])
  @@index([roomId])
}

// ── Template (Reusable board layouts saved by tutors) ──

model Template {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId   String
  name      String   @db.VarChar(50)
  subject   String   @default("GENERAL")
  snapshot  Json     // All pages serialized
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  tutor User @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([tutorId])
}

// ── Chat Message (Session text chat — not persisted after room purge) ──

model ChatMessage {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  roomId      String
  senderId    String?  // NULL for anonymous students
  senderLabel String   // "Tutor Name" or "Student 1"
  content     String   @db.Text
  fileUrl     String?  // Supabase Storage URL
  fileName    String?
  isPinned    Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now()) @db.Timestamp(6)

  room Room @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([roomId, createdAt])
}

// ── Usage Log (Monthly usage tracking for billing and throttles) ──

model UsageLog {
  id                  String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId              String
  periodStartDate     DateTime @db.Date
  videoMinutesUsed    Int      @default(0)
  aiCreditsUsed       Int      @default(0)
  estimatedAiSpendCents Int    @default(0)

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([userId, periodStartDate])
  @@index([userId])
}
